sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Buyer
    participant Client as Web / Mini App
    participant TG as Telegram
    participant API as reviews.routes
    participant Svc as reviews.service
    participant DB as Postgres

    alt Live delivery (same session)
        Buyer->>Client: Tap a star on the delivered dialog
        Client->>API: POST /reviews {order_id, brand_slug, rating} + Idempotency-Key
        API->>Svc: create_review(...)
        Svc->>DB: INSERT review (published, body null)
        Svc->>DB: bump brand_rating_stats
        API-->>Client: 201 ReviewOut
        opt Optional chips / comment within 15 min
            Buyer->>Client: Toggle chips and/or type, then Submit
            Client->>API: PATCH /reviews/{id} {body} + Idempotency-Key
            API-->>Client: 200 ReviewOut (rating unchanged)
            Client-->>Buyer: Thank-you (rating already saved; body now too)
        end
    else Buyer left to check the game, comes back later
        Note over Client,API: GET /reviews/pending-ask is 2h–14d, catalog only
        Buyer->>Client: Open Mini App / logged-in web (home or history)
        Client->>API: GET /reviews/pending-ask
        API-->>Client: {order_id, brand_slug, brand_name} or null
        Buyer->>Client: Tap a star (same POST as live)
    else Telegram delivery message
        TG-->>Buyer: "Заказ выдан" + web_app "Оценить заказ"
        Buyer->>Client: Launch /?review={order_id}
        Client->>Client: navigate /order/{id} → RateAsk
    end
